{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">早前，黃嘉雯陪同一班師妹前往湖南進行外景拍攝。在緊湊的工作之餘，她亦不忘抓緊時間遊覽當地的名勝美景，並在社交平台上載了一輯唯美寫真照，向粉絲大派福利，大方展現優雅且性感的一面。</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相片所見，黃嘉雯站在充滿古韻的木橋與石橋上留影，背景伴隨著小橋流水以及掛滿暖黃色燈籠的傳統建築物，整體氣氛相當浪漫唯美。當日，她身穿一襲焦糖色的斜肩掛頸連身長裙，完美凸顯出其窈窕勻稱的好身材。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2ab76072-ae02-4dd1-a47c-ac601147d238.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026s8qnwm2Y171785313258.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2ab76072-ae02-4dd1-a47c-ac601147d238.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3c901577-2868-49cc-80a6-2fb2a97a7e33.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026rLOKD6tl7b1785313257.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3c901577-2868-49cc-80a6-2fb2a97a7e33.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"286e0ada-bad8-4335-97fc-3af59501c938.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026uYFAQqylE01785313257.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"286e0ada-bad8-4335-97fc-3af59501c938.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">對於這次的湖南之旅，黃嘉雯亦感性地發文分享感受。她留言寫道：「從來無諗過湖南係咁好玩🤭古色古香，有山有水🏮」，對當地的獨特文化風情與自然美景讚不絕口。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T05:18:58.409905+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}